00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.760
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier,

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:03.220
and I hope you're doing very well today.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.820
You're looking lovely, I love the way you look!

